{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43119","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70898","text":"02 — Deployment Pipeline"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43121","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70899","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-70900","text":" How bundles are uploaded, validated, and deployed to runtime providers. Covers the immutable deployment model, version monotonicity, rollback mechanics, and the AgentCore container build pipeline."}]}],"id":"blk-43120","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-43122","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70901","text":"Deployment Model"}]},{"id":"blk-43123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70902","text":"Deployments are "},{"id":"spn-70903","marks":["bold"],"text":"immutable records"},{"id":"spn-70904","text":". Once created, a deployment's artifact, version, and configuration never change. Only "},{"id":"spn-70905","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-70906","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-70907","marks":["code"],"text":"error_message"},{"id":"spn-70908","text":" are updated during the lifecycle. Rollback works by switching the agent's "},{"id":"spn-70909","marks":["code"],"text":"active_deployment_id"},{"id":"spn-70910","text":" pointer -- not by modifying old deployments."}]},{"id":"blk-43124","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70911","text":"Deployment Fields"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43126","spans":[{"id":"spn-70912","text":"Field"}]},{"id":"blk-43127","spans":[{"id":"spn-70913","text":"Type"}]},{"id":"blk-43128","spans":[{"id":"spn-70914","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-43125","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43129","spans":[{"id":"spn-70915","marks":["code"],"text":"id"}]},{"id":"blk-43130","spans":[{"id":"spn-70916","text":"UUID"}]},{"id":"blk-43131","spans":[{"id":"spn-70917","text":"Immutable deployment identifier"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43132","spans":[{"id":"spn-70918","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_id"}]},{"id":"blk-43133","spans":[{"id":"spn-70919","text":"UUID"}]},{"id":"blk-43134","spans":[{"id":"spn-70920","text":"Parent agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43135","spans":[{"id":"spn-70921","marks":["code"],"text":"version"}]},{"id":"blk-43136","spans":[{"id":"spn-70922","text":"int"}]},{"id":"blk-43137","spans":[{"id":"spn-70923","text":"Monotonically increasing per agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43138","spans":[{"id":"spn-70924","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime_provider"}]},{"id":"blk-43139","spans":[{"id":"spn-70925","text":"enum"}]},{"id":"blk-43140","spans":[{"id":"spn-70926","marks":["code"],"text":"cloudflare"},{"id":"spn-70927","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-70928","marks":["code"],"text":"agentcore"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43141","spans":[{"id":"spn-70929","marks":["code"],"text":"status"}]},{"id":"blk-43142","spans":[{"id":"spn-70930","text":"enum"}]},{"id":"blk-43143","spans":[{"id":"spn-70931","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-70932","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-70933","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-70934","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-70935","marks":["code"],"text":"failed"},{"id":"spn-70936","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-70937","marks":["code"],"text":"rolled_back"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43144","spans":[{"id":"spn-70938","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact"}]},{"id":"blk-43145","spans":[{"id":"spn-70939","text":"JSONB"}]},{"id":"blk-43146","spans":[{"id":"spn-70940","text":"Upload reference (checksum, size)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43147","spans":[{"id":"spn-70941","marks":["code"],"text":"provider_ref"}]},{"id":"blk-43148","spans":[{"id":"spn-70942","text":"JSONB"}]},{"id":"blk-43149","spans":[{"id":"spn-70943","text":"Provider-specific deployment reference"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43150","spans":[{"id":"spn-70944","marks":["code"],"text":"commit_hash"}]},{"id":"blk-43151","spans":[{"id":"spn-70945","text":"string?"}]},{"id":"blk-43152","spans":[{"id":"spn-70946","text":"Optional git commit"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43153","spans":[{"id":"spn-70947","marks":["code"],"text":"error_message"}]},{"id":"blk-43154","spans":[{"id":"spn-70948","text":"string?"}]},{"id":"blk-43155","spans":[{"id":"spn-70949","text":"Failure details (sanitized, no secrets)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-43156","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70950","text":"Deploy Flow"}]},{"id":"blk-43157","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. UI uploads bundle (zip/tar)\n2. POST /functions/v1/deploy\n3. Edge Function:\n   a. Validate bundle (see validation rules below)\n   b. INSERT deployment (status: deploying)\n   c. Call RPI adapter: deploy(artifact, config, secrets)\n   d. On success:\n      - UPDATE deployment status -> active\n      - SET agents.active_deployment_id = deployment.id\n      - SET agents.status -> active\n   e. On failure:\n      - UPDATE deployment status -> failed\n      - SET error_message\n      - SET agents.status -> error"},{"id":"blk-43158","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70951","text":"Required Manifest: "},{"id":"spn-70952","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"}]},{"id":"blk-43159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70953","text":"Every bundle must include this file at the root:"}]},{"id":"blk-43160","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"entrypoint\": \"src/index.ts\",\n  \"runtime\": \"cloudflare\",\n  \"protocol\": \"invoke/v1\",\n  \"env\": {\n    \"requiredKeys\": [\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"],\n    \"optionalKeys\": [\"DEBUG\"]\n  },\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"streaming\": true,\n    \"tools\": false\n  }\n}"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43162","spans":[{"id":"spn-70954","text":"Field"}]},{"id":"blk-43163","spans":[{"id":"spn-70955","text":"Required"}]},{"id":"blk-43164","spans":[{"id":"spn-70956","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-43161","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43165","spans":[{"id":"spn-70957","marks":["code"],"text":"entrypoint"}]},{"id":"blk-43166","spans":[{"id":"spn-70958","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43167","spans":[{"id":"spn-70959","text":"Path to main file"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43168","spans":[{"id":"spn-70960","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime"}]},{"id":"blk-43169","spans":[{"id":"spn-70961","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43170","spans":[{"id":"spn-70962","text":"Must match agent's "},{"id":"spn-70963","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime_provider"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43171","spans":[{"id":"spn-70964","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-43172","spans":[{"id":"spn-70965","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43173","spans":[{"id":"spn-70966","text":"Must be "},{"id":"spn-70967","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43174","spans":[{"id":"spn-70968","marks":["code"],"text":"env.requiredKeys"}]},{"id":"blk-43175","spans":[{"id":"spn-70969","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43176","spans":[{"id":"spn-70970","text":"Secret keys that must exist in Vault"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43177","spans":[{"id":"spn-70971","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-43178","spans":[{"id":"spn-70972","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43179","spans":[{"id":"spn-70973","text":"Feature flags"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-43180","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70974","text":"Validation Rules (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-43181","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70975","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-70976","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"},{"id":"spn-70977","text":" exists and parses as valid JSON"}]}],"id":"blk-43182","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43185","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70978","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-70979","marks":["code"],"text":"entrypoint"},{"id":"spn-70980","text":" file exists in the bundle"}]}],"id":"blk-43184","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43187","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70981","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-70982","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime"},{"id":"spn-70983","text":" matches the agent's "},{"id":"spn-70984","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime_provider"}]}],"id":"blk-43186","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43189","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70985","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-70986","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol"},{"id":"spn-70987","text":" is "},{"id":"spn-70988","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"}]}],"id":"blk-43188","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43191","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70989","text":"[ ] Bundle size within limits (compressed and extracted)"}]}],"id":"blk-43190","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70990","text":"[ ] File count within limits"}]}],"id":"blk-43192","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70991","text":"[ ] No path traversal entries or unsafe symlinks"}]}],"id":"blk-43194","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70992","text":"[ ] Version is strictly greater than the previous deployment's version"}]}],"id":"blk-43196","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43198","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70993","text":"Version Monotonicity"}]},{"id":"blk-43199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70994","text":"Versions are monotonically increasing integers per agent. The platform auto-assigns the next version if not provided. Attempting to deploy a version less than or equal to the current maximum is rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-43200","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agent_id | version | status\n---------+---------+--------\nabc      | 1       | rolled_back\nabc      | 2       | rolled_back\nabc      | 3       | active     <-- current"},{"id":"blk-43201","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70995","text":"Rollback"}]},{"id":"blk-43202","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70996","text":"Rollback does "},{"id":"spn-70997","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-70998","text":" create a new deployment. It switches the active pointer:"}]},{"id":"blk-43203","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"curl -X POST \"$SUPABASE_URL/rest/v1/rpc/rollback_deployment\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -d '{ \"agent_id\": \"<uuid>\", \"deployment_id\": \"<target-uuid>\" }'"},{"id":"blk-43204","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70999","text":"The target deployment must have status "},{"id":"spn-71000","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-71001","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-71002","marks":["code"],"text":"rolled_back"},{"id":"spn-71003","text":" and belong to the same agent. The current active deployment is marked "},{"id":"spn-71004","marks":["code"],"text":"rolled_back"},{"id":"spn-71005","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43205","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-71006","text":"AgentCore Container Build Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-43206","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71007","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-71008","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime=agentcore"},{"id":"spn-71009","text":", the control plane converts the uploaded bundle into a container image:"}]},{"id":"blk-43207","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Extract and validate archive\n2. Build user code (TypeScript -> Node.js 20 artifact)\n3. Generate HTTP wrapper (invoke/v1 handler)\n4. Build OCI container image\n5. Push to ECR registry\n6. Create/update AgentCore runtime with image URI\n7. Inject env vars (telemetry key + user secrets)"},{"id":"blk-43208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71010","text":"The pipeline is idempotent per "},{"id":"spn-71011","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment_id"},{"id":"spn-71012","text":" -- retries produce the same provider state."}]},{"id":"blk-43209","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-71013","text":"Concurrent Deploy Guard"}]},{"id":"blk-43210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71014","text":"Only one deployment can be in "},{"id":"spn-71015","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-71016","text":" status per agent at a time. The Edge Function must check for existing in-progress deployments and reject concurrent attempts with an appropriate error."}]},{"id":"blk-43211","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-71017","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-43212","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71018","text":"[ ] Bundle includes valid "},{"id":"spn-71019","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"}]}],"id":"blk-43213","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43216","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71020","text":"[ ] Entrypoint file exists"}]}],"id":"blk-43215","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71021","text":"[ ] Runtime matches agent configuration"}]}],"id":"blk-43217","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71022","text":"[ ] Version is monotonically increasing"}]}],"id":"blk-43219","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71023","text":"[ ] Bundle passes size and file count limits"}]}],"id":"blk-43221","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43224","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71024","text":"[ ] No concurrent deploys for the same agent"}]}],"id":"blk-43223","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43226","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71025","text":"[ ] Secrets referenced in manifest exist in Vault"}]}],"id":"blk-43225","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71026","text":"[ ] Deployment record is immutable after creation (except status/error)"}]}],"id":"blk-43227","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43230","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-71027","text":"[ ] AgentCore builds produce deterministic container images"}]}],"id":"blk-43229","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieran54fe3agl2foqiuytgipqxpottltzootrug3cz6lhzkex5li3x2a","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}